From d84e1e24e652aa4dd9216415325764407f8899d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kevinbrar2024 <kevinbrar2024@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:08:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix singular exiled-card placement

Lower singular a/an card-exiled-this-way placement to an up-to-one tracked-exile choice followed by a single-object move. Keep mandatory wording exact-one, make optional decline a no-op, and bind the Haste and delayed-return continuation to the chosen object. Forward complements only to direct zone-move receivers.
